    oa:editorialNote "---- the Transcend -------------------------------------------------------" ;
    oa:kind "polity_marker" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "Around YTS 2190 751 6, in what the Encyclopaedia calls the Norma Outer Sector — a designation of Orion's Arm's own that the Celestia add-on does not carry, so there is nothing to bind to. The constellation is recorded and no distance is given, so nothing is drawn." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

